msgstr "Importe del impuesto"

#: models.py:365
msgid "Tax percentage"
msgstr "Ingame Corp Tax"

#: models.py:366 templates/eos_tax/index.html:46
#: templates/eos_tax/index.html:120
msgid "Paid"
msgstr "Pagado"

#: models.py:383
msgid "Applied alliance tax rate"
msgstr "Tasa de Alliance aplicada"

#: models.py:386
msgid ""
"Alliance rate in effect when this row was calculated. Stored per row so "
"changing the rate does not rewrite what past months were owed."
msgstr ""
"Tasa de la Alliance vigente cuando se calculó esta fila. Se guarda por fila "
"para que un cambio de tasa no reescriba lo que se debía en meses pasados."

#: models.py:392
msgid "Amount to pay"
msgstr "Importe a pagar"

#: models.py:395
msgid ""
"ISK owed to the alliance for this month, in whole ISK. Worked out from "
"tax_value, tax_percentage and alliance_tax_rate whenever the row is written, "
"and kept with them from then on - the page, the chart and the payment check "
"read it rather than redoing the arithmetic."
msgstr ""
"ISK que se deben a la Alliance por este mes, en ISK enteros. Se calcula a "
"partir de tax_value, tax_percentage y alliance_tax_rate cada vez que se "
"escribe la fila y se guarda junto a ellos; la página, el gráfico y la "
"comprobación de pagos lo leen en lugar de volver a calcularlo."

#: models.py:403
msgid "Amount paid"
msgstr "Importe pagado"

#: models.py:407
msgid ""
"ISK the payment check found for this month, in whole ISK: with reason codes "
"every payment carrying this row's code added up, without them the amount "
"owed once a payment of exactly that turned up. Empty until a payment was "
"seen."
msgstr ""
"ISK que la comprobación de pagos encontró para este mes, en ISK enteros: con "
"códigos de reason, la suma de todos los pagos que llevan el código de esta "
"fila; sin ellos, el importe adeudado en cuanto apareció un pago exactamente "
"por ese importe. Vacío hasta que se vea un pago."

