"Active hours per day. An hour counts as active once the same taxed\n"
"                journal type appears in it at least %(min_entries)s times, "
"which is the same rule the\n"
"                list uses. Times are EVE time."
msgstr ""
"Horas activas por día. Una hora cuenta como activa cuando el mismo journal "
"type gravado aparece en ella al menos %(min_entries)s veces, la misma regla "
"que usa la lista. Horas en tiempo de EVE."

#: templates/eos_tax/bot-detail.html:205
